  "releaseNotes": "1.0.9: first stable of the pure-tkv line (graduates 1.0.4-1.0.8-dev). SQL SELECT engine on DataFrames (pandas-verified), Excel SpreadsheetML IO, Parquet honest ledger, parallel CSV (~1.1-1.8x). 21/21 suites green (sql 43/43, excel 33/33), DLL smoke 54/54 + functional C# calls. Dead C# era removed.",
